WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.310
Hey this is Presh Talwalkar. This puzzle is making the rounds on Facebook.

00:00:05.819 --> 00:00:12.000
In fact, one of the times it was posted,
it was shared more than 400,000 times.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:22.400
The puzzle is: Can you fix the equation 6
+ 4 = 4 by moving exactly one matchstick?

00:00:24.100 --> 00:00:28.859
In these puzzles there are typically some ground rules.

00:00:28.859 --> 00:00:31.650
You cannot break any of the sticks.

00:00:31.650 --> 00:00:37.140
You must make a valid equation with an
equals sign. And in this particular

00:00:37.140 --> 00:00:42.809
problem, you should restrict yourself to
numbers that you can display using seven

00:00:42.809 --> 00:00:47.219
segments. These are the block numbers
from 0 to 9.

00:00:47.219 --> 00:00:55.000
Can you figure it out? Give it a try
before watching the rest of the video for the solution.

00:00:59.500 --> 00:01:06.500
So one way you can solve
this problem is by making the equation 0+4=4.

00:01:06.500 --> 00:01:11.520
You take this matchstick and rotate it 90 degrees to

00:01:11.520 --> 00:01:18.270
make the number zero. So you end up with the valid equation 0+4=4.

00:01:20.000 --> 00:01:26.360
There's also another solution, you can
make the equation 8-4=4

00:01:26.369 --> 00:01:34.259
To do that, you take this stick from the
+ sign and join it to the six. Now you

00:01:34.259 --> 00:01:43.000
have 8-4=4 which is also valid. These are the two solutions I know.

00:01:43.000 --> 00:01:47.700
Are there any other solutions? Let us know in the comments.

00:01:48.860 --> 00:01:53.740
