00:01:55.049 --> 00:01:59.340
Mind Your Decisions which you can follow
on Facebook, Google+, and Patreon. You can

00:01:59.340 --> 00:02:02.820
catch me on social media @preshtalwalkar,  and if you like this video please

00:02:02.820 --> 00:02:05.340
check out my books there are links are in the video description.

